#### Problem 1: Cascading Failures from Tight Coupling

**Current State**:

```csharp
// Claims API - Synchronous provider validation
public class ClaimsSubmissionService
{
    private readonly IProviderClient _providerClient;
    private readonly IEligibilityClient _eligibilityClient;
    private readonly IPriorAuthClient _priorAuthClient;

    public async Task<ClaimResult> SubmitClaimAsync(Claim claim)
    {
        // Synchronous call to provider service
        var provider = await _providerClient.ValidateProviderAsync(
            claim.ProviderId,
            timeout: TimeSpan.FromSeconds(5));

        if (!provider.IsActive || !provider.IsInNetwork)
            return ClaimResult.Rejected(\"Provider not eligible\");

        // Synchronous call to eligibility service
        var member = await _eligibilityClient.CheckEligibilityAsync(
            claim.MemberId,
            claim.ServiceDate,
            timeout: TimeSpan.FromSeconds(5));

        if (!member.IsEligible)
            return ClaimResult.Rejected(\"Member not eligible\");

        // Synchronous call to prior auth service
        var priorAuth = await _priorAuthClient.CheckAuthorizationAsync(
            claim.ServiceCode,
            claim.MemberId,
            timeout: TimeSpan.FromSeconds(10));

        if (priorAuth.IsRequired && !priorAuth.IsApproved)
            return ClaimResult.Pended(\"Prior authorization required\");

        // Process claim adjudication
        var adjudication = await _adjudicationEngine.ProcessAsync(claim);

        return ClaimResult.Success(adjudication);
    }
}
```

**Impact**:
- **Fragile Dependencies**: Claims API depends on 3+ synchronous services; if any service is slow/down, claim submission fails
- **Cumulative Latency**: P95 response time is sum of all dependent service latencies (5s + 5s + 10s = 20+ seconds)
- **Cascading Failures**: Provider service outage causes claims API errors, affecting all downstream consumers
- **Amplified Load**: When services slow down, retries amplify load creating death spiral
- **Poor User Experience**: Providers wait 20+ seconds for claim submission response, with frequent timeout errors

**Business Consequence**:
Claim submission failures during peak periods degrade provider experience, generate support tickets, and risk SLA violations when claims processing availability drops below contractual thresholds.

